    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "你好，我的伙计",
              "en": "Hello, my buddy"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我想你肯定也对这里的空气感到厌烦了......到处都是烂泥的味道",
              "en": "I'm sure you must be getting tired of the air here too... It smells like mud everywhere"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我在想，如果我们击败了僵尸博士，应该就能利用他的机器离开这个充满沼泽时代",
              "en": "I'm thinking, if we defeat Dr. Zomboss, we should be able to use his machine to leave this swamp-filled era"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "如果你想要，那就得自己来拿。这道理你是清楚的",
              "en": "If you want it, then you'll have to take it.you already knew that."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "呵呵呵呵哈哈......",
              "en": "Hehehehehaha ....."
            }
          }
        ]
